cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Dog breed classification: from a classical PCA and HOG pipeline to transfer learning"
abstract: >-
  Classification of six dog breeds of the Stanford Dogs dataset, comparing a
  classical pipeline built with scikit-learn and scikit-image (bounding box
  cropping, aspect-preserving resizing, PCA and HOG features, kNN and SVM
  classifiers tuned by grid search) with transfer learning on a frozen VGG16
  network. The classical pipeline plateaus around 60 % of accuracy, the
  transfer learning reaches 98 %.
